OL,4,CAnthropic becomes one of world's most  
OL,5,Cvaluable public companies in stock     
OL,6,Cmarket debut                           
OL,7,GAnthropic has become one of the most   
OL,8,Gvaluable public companies in the world 
OL,9,Gafter its shares began trading on the  
OL,10,Gstock market, taking its valuation to  
OL,11,Groughly $1.76 trillion (#1.34          
OL,12,Gtrillion).                             
OL,14,FThe artificial intelligence (AI)       
OL,15,Fcompany's Thursday debut on the Nasdaq 
OL,16,Fstock exchange was a crucial test for  
OL,17,Fthe industry, given the huge amount of 
OL,18,Fmoney being poured into advancing the  
OL,19,Ftechnology.                            
